WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.950
House of the Dragon is a Game of Thrones prequel
show that is confirmed by HBO’s president

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.120
to air in 2022.
Miguel Sapochnik and Ryan Condal will serve

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.360
as showrunners and executive producers. George
R. R. Martin will also serve as executive

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:28.580
producer.
It is based on George RR Martin’s Targaryen

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:32.870
history book Fire And Blood volume 1 and on
Martin’s yet unfinished Fire And Blood volume

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:35.710
2 book.
“Fire &amp; Blood begins their tale with the

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:40.590
legendary Aegon the Conqueror, creator of
the Iron Throne, and goes on to recount the

00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:45.340
generations of Targaryens who fought to hold
that iconic seat, all the way up to the civil

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:49.980
war that nearly tore their dynasty apart.”
That's Fire And Blood volume 1.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:55.180
The yet unreleased Fire And Blood volume 2
will continue from where part 1 ended, with

00:00:55.180 --> 00:01:01.050
Rhaenyra Targaryen's son Aegon lll's reign
and will cover Blackyre rebellions, war with

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:06.640
Dorne and go all the way to the Mad King and
Robert's Rebellion that ended Targaryen dynasty.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:19.670
Key event of the prequel will be the Dance
of the Dragon, a Targaryen civil war.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:23.759
The Dance of the Dragons was the most devastating
war in the history of the Seven Kingdoms.

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:29.139
A war of succession between Aegon II and his
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys

00:01:29.139 --> 00:01:40.560
I's throne.
Targaryens fought Targaryens, bothers fought

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:49.340
brothers, dragons fought dragons.
One of the supporters of Rhaenyra was Nettles.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:54.259
Nettles was a dragon-rider for Rhaenyra Targaryen's
faction during the Dance of the Dragons.

00:01:54.259 --> 00:01:59.270
She was either a lover or bastard daughter
of Daemon Targaryen, or maybe even both.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:04.749
Nettles, also known as Netty, was a dragonseed
and the first and possibly the last dragonrider

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:10.190
of the dragon Sheepstealer. Netty was a small
brown-skinned girl with black hair and brown

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.319
eyes.
This would make Nettles the only non-white

00:02:13.319 --> 00:02:19.150
dragon-rider in the history of Westeros (although
not the only female dragon-rider: several

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:24.790
women in Rhaenyra's faction including Rhaenyra
herself were dragon-riders). The skinny girl

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:31.450
had crooked teeth and scarred nose. According
to Gyldayn, she could not be called pretty.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:36.939
Nettles was foul-mouthed, filthy, and fearless.
Nettles was a bastard of House Targaryen - known

00:02:36.939 --> 00:02:41.590
as one of the "dragonseeds".
Her exact parentage is unknown, but she did

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:47.739
not resemble her Targaryen ancestors - instead
she was notably dark-skinned (like a Summer

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:53.519
Islander). According to Mushroom, Nettles
was a bastard of uncertain birth. She grew

00:02:53.519 --> 00:02:58.219
up homeless in Spicetown and Hull on the island
of Driftmark.

00:02:58.219 --> 00:03:03.190
According to Septon Eustace, the girl's nose
was slit after she was caught thieving.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:08.700
Her cunning and intelligence was best evidenced
in how she managed to claim her dragon.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:13.000
As the great Targaryen civil war known as
the Dance of the Dragons progressed, Rhaenyra

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:17.629
Targaryen's faction - which was based on Dragonstone
- realized that they had more living dragons

00:03:17.629 --> 00:03:21.810
than dragon-riders, with six riderless beasts
nesting on the island.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:27.000
It’s believed that only those of Targaryen
blood can successfully bond with and ride

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.090
a dragon, so they proclaimed rewards for any
commoners on Dragonstone who could successfully

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:38.810
bond with one of the unclaimed dragons specifically
Targaryen bastards and descendants of Targaryen

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:43.819
bastards who had been fathered over the years
on commoners of the island by young Targaryen

00:03:43.819 --> 00:03:48.930
princes. When it was decided by Prince Jacaerys
Velaryon that the blacks needed more dragonriders

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:54.680
during the Dance of the Dragons, several "dragonseeds"
on Dragonstone came forward to answer the

00:03:54.680 --> 00:04:01.780
prince's call in 129 AC. Many died or were
injured by dragons, but then the sixteen years

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:07.250
of age, Nettles was able to tame the wild
dragon Sheepstealer. Three of the dragons

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:13.189
had known riders before so they were claimed
before too long, but the other three were

00:04:13.189 --> 00:04:18.370
"wild" dragons - they had grown to adulthood
never being successfully claimed by any rider

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.590
at all, and thus were unused to the presence
of humans. Eventually many thought it was

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:29.360
impossible to bond with a wild dragon at all
- until Nettles became the only one to succeed,

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:35.140
when she bonded with the dragon known as "Sheepstealer"
(a basic descriptive name the commoners of

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:40.640
the island referred to him by, given that
he had a taste for sheep from their flocks).

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.810
Nettles realized that simply walking right
up to a wild dragon and attempting to mount

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:51.130
it was foolhardy (and had gotten many of the
other dragonseeds killed), so she cleverly

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:56.490
left a freshly killed sheep every day for
an extended period of time, allowing Sheepstealer

00:04:56.490 --> 00:05:02.190
to become gradually used to her presence.
Nettles rode her dragon throughout the rest

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:08.260
of the war. Her dragon Sheepstealer was actually
one of the older and larger ones in the Dance,

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:14.230
hatched "when the Old King was young" (Jaehaerys
I) meaning he was at least 80 years old and

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:20.060
probably bigger than either Rhaenyra's dragon
Syrax or Daemon's dragon Caraxes. He was described

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:25.590
as being an ugly mud-brown color for this
reason, not unlike Nettles herself, previous

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:31.050
Targaryens had ignored Sheepstealer, preferring
dragons with what they felt were more beautiful

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:36.750
colors. Nettles participated in the massive
Battle of the Gullet, one of the largest naval

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:42.520
battles in history. Nettles fought valiantly
on behalf of Queen Rhaenyra Targaryen in the

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:48.480
Battle of the Gullet. While her fellow dragonriders
Hugh the Hammer and Ulf the White celebrated

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:54.380
after the battle, Nettles was upset by the
death of Jacaerys. During the fall of King's

00:05:54.380 --> 00:06:00.770
Landing, Nettles landed Sheepstealer on Visenya's
Hill. After the capture of King's Landing,

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:06.330
she accompanied Rhaenyra's husband (and uncle)
Daemon Targaryen with his dragon Caraxes,

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:11.240
as they hunted through the Riverlands for
Prince Aemond Targaryen on the great dragon

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:17.440
Vhagar, who was burning out the entire region
in a one-man, one-dragon private war. Despite

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:23.770
having the largest and greatest living dragon
alive, however, Aemond was at least wise enough

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:29.530
not to risk riding Vhagar into a two-against-one
fight, so he simply withdrew whenever they

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:34.480
neared and moved on to burn out some other
part of the Riverlands. While searching the

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:39.560
riverlands for Prince Aemond Targaryen and
Vhagar, Prince Daemon Targaryen, Rhaenyra's

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:45.960
husband, was constantly accompanied by Nettles,
both in the sky and at their base, Maidenpool.

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:52.690
According to Mushroom, Daemon had come to
love the girl and took her as his bedmate.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:56.570
In contrast, Norren, the maester at Maidenpool,
stated the dragonriders had separate bedrooms

00:06:56.570 --> 00:07:02.630
and that Daemon doted upon Nettles "as a man
might dote upon his daughter". Norren described

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:08.250
Daemon teaching Nettles common courtesies
and giving her fine gifts such as an ivory

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:15.460
hairbrush, a silvered looking glass, a velvet
and satin cloak, and leather riding boots.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:21.641
Maidservants said Daemon showed Nettles how
to wash, sharing a single tub at times. Given

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:26.740
that Daemon was old enough to be Nettles's
father, it’s not impossible that she actually

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:31.950
was his bastard daughter, and this is the
reason they seemed to have unusually close

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:36.870
bond. Queen Rhaenyra's court at the Red Keep
was outraged by the treasons of Tumbleton

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:44.000
done by Ulf and Hugh. Lady Mysaria, long Daemon's
paramour, fed the growing distrust of Rhaenyra

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:48.690
against the dragonseeds with rumors about
Nettles and Daemon's relationship. Rhaenyra

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:54.630
now mistrusted all the dragonseeds, including
the girl who rode with her husband Daemon,

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:59.790
hunting Aemond in the Riverlands. She ordered
the girl's head to be sent to her. But there

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:05.211
was a complication; as well as her dragon,
the girl had taken to riding Daemon, according

00:08:05.211 --> 00:08:10.310
to some, while according to others, Daemon
simply took care of her as if she was his

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:17.050
own child. Rhaenyra raged, declaring that
Nettles used spells to bond with Sheepstealer

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:23.620
and to seduce the prince. The queen sent a
raven to Manfryd Mooton, Lord of Maidenpool,

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:28.240
requesting the girl's head and ordering Daemon
to return to the capital. Manfryd and his

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:33.770
advisors disobeyed, however. When Maester
Norren informed Daemon that Rhaenyra had declared

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:39.890
Nettles a traitor, Daemon was disgusted and
allowed her to escape. After killing a large

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:45.500
black ram and feeding it to her dragon, a
tearful Nettles flew Sheepstealer into the

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:51.700
morning mists of the Bay of Crabs.
The disappearance of Nettles enraged Rhaenyra.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:56.640
Instead of returning to his wife, Daemon flew
to Harrenhal, where he issued a challenge

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:03.470
to Aemond to come and face him alone. Both
Aemond and Daemon later arrived at Harrenhal

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:08.530
with their dragons and in the subsequent Battle
Above the Gods Eye where both men and both

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:13.670
dragons perished. Since Daemon's body was
never found in the Gods Eye while Aemond's

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:19.490
was as well as their dragons, some songs claim
that he survived the encounter and found his

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:24.780
way back to Nettles. There are multiple theories
about Nettles' fate that people in the world

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:29.960
of Westeros believe. Some believe that she
rode out so far over the sea that Sheepstealer

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:36.910
was too tired to fly back to land, and both
dragon and rider drowned. Nettles and Sheepstealer

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:41.600
were never seen again.
Rumors abound, however, that this was just

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:47.220
a ruse to hide from Rhaenyra, and in truth
Nettles later doubled back to land, and that

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:52.550
Daemon miraculously survived his fall into
the Gods Eye lake, and the two lived out their

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:58.850
days together on the hidden Isle of Faces
- this tale is popular among the romantic

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:03.780
singers. Some maesters believe that the Burned
Men originated from members of the Painted

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:09.370
Dogs who worshipped a fire-witch who would
be Nettles and her dragon who would be Sheepstealer

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:14.820
in a hidden vale after the Dance, bringing
gifts to the dragon woman and displaying burns

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:21.150
as proof of their valor. Nettles reportedly
spent her days in the Vale. When King Aegon

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:26.360
II Targaryen regained the Iron Throne after
Rhaenyra's death, there were reports that

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:33.511
Sheepstealer had been seen at Crackclaw Point
and the Mountains of the Moon. In 134 AC during

00:10:33.511 --> 00:10:39.070
the reign of King Aegon III Targaryen, Ser
Robert Rowan led a royal army to the Vale

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:45.010
of Arryn to support Ser Joffrey Arryn. Robert's
men encountered Sheepstealer and ragged Nettles

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:52.790
in a cave and in the ensuing fight sixteen
men were slain and threescore more were wounded.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:57.551
Nettles and her dragon were last seen flying
deeper into the Mountains of the Moon. There

00:10:57.551 --> 00:11:02.960
is no doubt that Fire And Blood volume 2 will
offer certain answers to these questions when

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:08.610
the book is finally released. Who knows maybe
we even read about legendary Daemon Targaryen

00:11:08.610 --> 00:11:13.820
again who might be alive and well with Nettles.
Whatever the case, Nettles, as a Targaryen

00:11:13.820 --> 00:11:18.100
bastard and a dragonrider plays an important
role in the House of the Dragon and it will

00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:22.800
be interesting to see how all the mysteries
surrounding her will be portrayed, from her

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:28.310
heritage to her relationship with Daemon,
to whatever happens with her later. Again,

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:33.010
House of the Dragon, Game of Thrones prequel
based on House Targaryen's most exciting parts

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:38.700
of history is coming in 2022 on HBO. Let me
know your thoughts about all of this in the

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:42.500
comment section down below.
Thank you so much for watching, hope you enjoyed

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.063
this video and if you did make sure to give
it a big thumbs upand I hope to see you in

00:11:45.063 --> 00:11:45.073
the next one, peace!

